'''Fortressy''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] and can be unlocked as a daily stamp during the [[Neo Mushroom Garden Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 280
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Fortressy
|name2 = Castley
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Castley''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Despite being advertised as a tanky Cat, Fortressy is not tanky at all, even with hypermax. Adding to that, its cost is 30¢ more than [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]], who is a much better, more ideal meatshield in every situation, no matter what part of the game you're in. The most this Cat can help you with is being a 4 Crown [[Stories of Legend]] meatshield; with the [[Cat Combo|Catcombos]] [[Biohazard (Combo)|Biohazard]] and [[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bony Bone]] supporting it, it can be spammed relatively quickly, despite its low movement speed, not different from how [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] is used throughout similar stages.

Despite this, the previously mentioned Cats are a much better investment of XP; so invest in them rather than Fortressy. Overall, the most Fortressy can do to help your Cat Army is increasing your [[User Rank]] and, although not recommended, being a meatshield in Stories of Legend.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

